{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415045","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415045","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041504501:1":{"text":"まあ、妖精なんて久しぶりに会ったわ……最後に目にしたのはいつだったかしら……","source_cn":"我已经很久没有见到过妖精了……上一次，是什么时候来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6454B7629D6A8C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504502:1":{"text":"茨の隊長の就任式のために、あなたが早起きしてお花を摘みに行った時よ！","source_cn":"……是你特意起了个大早去摘花，给荆棘队长授职仪式做准备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38C5C2042CD341F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504503:1":{"text":"あ、あら、そうだったわね。でもどうして知っているの？","source_cn":"哦？哦……对。奇怪，你怎么知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CC043625E5D61A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504504:1":{"text":"それは……ふふっ！自己紹介するわね。あたしはタシー、普段は夢の中で暮らしている、夢の守人よ。","source_cn":"这个嘛……嘻嘻！正式介绍一下，我是塔西，是一名梦守妖精...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80984394A8CCF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504505:1":{"text":"いつだったかしら。あなたの夢を通りかかったことがあるのよ。だから、あなたが知らないだけで、あたしたちはけっこう前に会ってるの。","source_cn":"说不准什么时候，我路过了你的梦境，所以我们认识的时候，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE83913F6B830E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504506:1":{"text":"そうなのね、でも、それって寂しくないの……？","source_cn":"啊……这样说起来，你不会感觉到孤单吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD61BF0C4691D6CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504507:1":{"text":"だってほとんどの人は、目が覚めたら夢のことなんて覚えてないわ。でも、あなたは覚えているのでしょう？","source_cn":"毕竟大多数人醒来就把梦忘得一干二净，只有你保留着在梦里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA001E6E2D0ADA843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504508:1":{"text":"ふふ、優しいのね。あなたの夢と同じ、繊細で思いやりのある人だわ。","source_cn":"哇……你好温柔啊，果然像你的梦境一样，是个细腻体贴的人呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD43C5882751795F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504509:1":{"text":"私は自分の夢を覚えていないの。よかったら、どんなだったか教えてくれる？","source_cn":"我记不清自己做过什么样的梦，你可以和我说说吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF264F53F4D60556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504510:1":{"text":"もちろん、喜んで！","source_cn":"哎呀呀，又到我最喜欢的环节了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B1869FA0EE2D479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504511:1":{"text":"夢のことを教えるのが大好きなの！好奇心をかき立てられた相手は、夢がさらに変化するのよ！これは何度経験しても飽きないわ！","source_cn":"用别人梦里精彩的经历来勾起他们的好奇心，再逐个揭露，等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594CCD565BAA8277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504512:1":{"text":"ふふ、そう言われると、私も実際に夢の世界へ行ってみたくなったわ。","source_cn":"呵呵……听你说的，我都想亲自去我的梦里瞧瞧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACBFB98F15B04E97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504513:1":{"text":"あたしも、次に夢の中であなたに会えるのが今から楽しみよ！","source_cn":"说到这里，我已经开始期待我们下一次梦中冒险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5AA3A23E4F15595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504514:1":{"text":"それじゃあ、前回の夢がどんなだったか教えてくれる？","source_cn":"那么，可以告诉我，我上一次的梦境是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA360B1DE3B7BF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504515:1":{"text":"ええ。これだけは自信を持って言えるけど、パリーサ、あなたの夢はあなたの想像を遥かに超えるわ。","source_cn":"当然，我可以肯定地说……帕瑞莎，你的梦境远超过你的想象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D043BCE0DB3A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_sta